        "statement": "Device raw/display location, camera center, saved viewport/project extent, selected geometry and entered coordinates are distinct. Trace effective widget/binding, units/CRS/axes/freshness, state gates and action side effects before using UI as evidence. Preserve source review and runtime UNKNOWN separately; new confirmed links are persisted without a separate request.\n",
